  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La XXX Fira del Libre de Onda, que se celebra en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura desde el pasado viernes, 29 de mayo, est&aacute; tocando a su fin, pues termina este domingo con gran animaci&oacute;n. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040706.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">No s&oacute;lo por las visitas del alumnado de 1&ordf; a 4&ordm; de Primaria por las ma&ntilde;anas, sino que por las tardes, y especialmente el primer fin de semana, ha estado muy concurrida.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040666.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La tarde de este jueves se han entregado en La Cassola los premios del III certamen literario &#39;El tabaco es un cuento&#39;, que organiza la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer en Onda y l&#39;Alcora.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La lista de premios es la siguiente:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><u style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><b>RELACION DE GANADORES&nbsp;</b><strong>DE ONDA</strong><b>&nbsp;DEL 3er CERTAMEN LITERARIO &#39;EL TABACO ES UN CUENTO&#39; DE LA ACCC (PRIMARIA)</b></u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">C M&ordf; ROSA MOLAS</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&quot;Mi querido diario&quot; MARTA CEREZUELA PIQUER</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">CEIP MIRALCAMP</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;La lecci&oacute;n de Ana&raquo; NEREA PRADES PERALTA</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Locura por los cigarros&raquo; DUNA C&Aacute;RDENAS JIM&Eacute;NEZ</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">CEIP P&Iacute;O XII</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;El sue&ntilde;o de Marta&raquo; CARLA FELIU VIVES</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Contaminados&raquo; CRISTINA MOTOS GIMENO</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">C VIRGEN DEL CARMEN</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Abre los ojos&raquo; LAURA REGINA GONZALEZ ARCAS (1&ordm; PREMIO PROVINCIAL)</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;La princesa de cristal&raquo; NAYARA P&Eacute;REZ MONFERRER</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">CEIP BALTASAR RULL</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Llepolitabac&raquo; MEGAN THIRLBY MORENO</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Antitabacman&raquo; MARIA JULVE BENAGES</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">CEIP MESTRE CABALLERO</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo; La misi&oacute;n inesperada&raquo; MELANI MACIAS COLLADO</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Sugar y el mundo&raquo; LUC&Iacute;A RODRIGUEZ REQUENA</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><b>RELACION DE PREMIOS&nbsp;</b><strong>DE L&#39;ALCORA (PRIMARIA)</strong><b>)</b></u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px;\"><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">COMTE D&acute;ARANDA</u></i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo; La obsesi&oacute;n de mi abuelo&raquo; MARC GUILL&Eacute;N NEBOT</i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Los sentimientos contra el tabaco&raquo; RAUL BAG&Aacute;N BOU</i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px;\"><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">LA SALLE</u></i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;No quiero que me pase igual&raquo; DANIEL PE&Eacute;</i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">PU&Eacute;RTOLAS PARDO</u></i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Los superheroes contra el tabaco mundial&raquo; ELENA FERRES GASCH</i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px;\"><u style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">FRANCISCO GRANGEL</u></i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><i style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Jorge y su experiencia con el tabaco&raquo; LAIA ROMERO GIL</i></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u><b style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">RELACION DE PREMIOS L&#39;ALCORA (SECUNDARIA)</b></u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">IES PU&Eacute;RTOLAS PARDO</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;El tabaquismo produce cancer&raquo; MAR&iacute;A GARC&iacute;A S&Aacute;NCHEZ</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><u style=\"font-size: 12.8000001907349px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">IES LA SALLE</u></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&laquo;Un sue&ntilde;o truncado&raquo; MARIA GIMENO MARTINEZ ( 1&ordm; PREMIO PROVINCIAL )</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"http://onda.es/la-ciudad/eventos/30-fira-del-llibre\" target=\"_blank\">Se ha seguido todo el programa previsto, excepto la presentaci&oacute;n de lunes por la tarde</a> a cargo de Nouri Mansouri. Tampoco acudi&oacute; su sustituto, Vicente Engu&iacute;danos.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1030844.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Como an&eacute;cdota, se&ntilde;alar que la tarde del s&aacute;bado salt&oacute; la alarma de incendios al enceder un papelito, del que salieron unos billetes, el mago Frisco, tras la presentaci&oacute;n del libroToda una vida de memorias y an&eacute;cdotas, de Mel y Chispa. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040476.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La tarde del martes, tambi&eacute;n en La Cassola, se entregaron los premios del taller de literatura fant&aacute;stica, que han quedado como sigue:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 62, 77); font-family: helvetica, arial, 'lucida grande', sans-serif; line-height: 15.3599996566772px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(246, 247, 248);\">4&ordm; puesto: ALEXANDER &ndash; Iv&aacute;n Chamarro Herrero</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 62, 77); font-family: helvetica, arial, 'lucida grande', sans-serif; line-height: 15.3599996566772px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(246, 247, 248);\">3er puesto: HETEROFOBIA &ndash; Irene Moreno Alguacil</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span data-reactid=\".8g.$mid=11433498895570=285b910348fc7e47899.2:0.0.0.0.0.0.$end:0:$text10:0\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 62, 77); font-family: helvetica, arial, 'lucida grande', sans-serif; line-height: 15.3599996566772px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(246, 247, 248);\">2&ordm; puesto: LA SONRISA ETERNA &ndash; David Jim&eacute;nez Faul&iacute;</span><br data-reactid=\".8g.$mid=11433498895570=285b910348fc7e47899.2:0.0.0.0.0.0.$end:0:$text11:0\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 62, 77); font-family: helvetica, arial, 'lucida grande', sans-serif; line-height: 15.3599996566772px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(246, 247, 248);\" />\n <span data-reactid=\".8g.$mid=11433498895570=285b910348fc7e47899.2:0.0.0.0.0.0.$end:0:$text12:0\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 62, 77); font-family: helvetica, arial, 'lucida grande', sans-serif; line-height: 15.3599996566772px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(246, 247, 248);\">1er puesto: M&Iacute;RAME A LOS OJOS &ndash; Marta Palanques Herrera</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n"
